# Protagonist — Cursor AI Context

You are building **Protagonist**, an AI-powered life coaching app with RPG game mechanics.
Always read this file fully before writing any code. Every decision should align with this context.

---

## What This App Is

Protagonist is a voice-first, AI-powered life companion that turns the user's real life into an RPG.
The user talks to an AI coach called **The Oracle (Arc)**. The Oracle listens, understands their
emotional state and life context, generates 3 calibrated daily quests, tracks progress across 7 life
dimensions, and witnesses the user's growth over time.

**Core principle:** The user should never have to type. Voice is the primary interface.
**Core mechanic:** Talk → Get quests → Live life → Protagonist tracks the rest.
**Core differentiator:** The app adapts to the user's real energy and circumstances daily.
It knows when to push and when to hold space.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Framework | Next.js 14+ (App Router) |
| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS |
| Database + Auth | Supabase |
| AI / Agents | Anthropic Claude API (claude-sonnet-4-6) |
| Voice Transcription | Web Speech API (browser) + Whisper API fallback |
| Health Data | Oura Ring API (sleep, HRV, readiness) |
| Movement Data | Apple HealthKit (via API routes) |
| Email + Calendar | Google Calendar API, Gmail API |
| Photo AI | Claude Vision API (multimodal) |
| Deployment | Vercel |

**Environment variables required:**
```
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
OURA_CLIENT_ID=
OURA_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
```

