## Design System

### Colors
```css
--bg: #0D0820          /* Deep space background */
--bg2: #130E2A         /* Section backgrounds */
--bg3: #1A1238         /* Card headers, inputs */
--purple: #7B3FE4      /* Primary accent */
--purple-light: #A87EF8
--salmon: #FF7A65      /* Secondary accent — warm salmon/coral */
--salmon-light: #FFB0A3
--cyan: #00D4B8        /* Tertiary accent */
--gold: #FFB347        /* XP, achievements, Oracle crown */
--mint: #6EE7A4        /* Success, completion */
--txt: #F0ECFF         /* Primary text */
--txt2: #9B8EC4        /* Secondary text */
--txt3: #6B5E8C        /* Muted text */
--card: rgba(255,255,255,0.04)
--card-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08)
```

### Typography
- **Headings:** Space Grotesk, 700 weight
- **Body:** Space Grotesk, 400/500 weight
- **Emotional moments / quotes:** Playfair Display, italic 700
- Google Fonts import: `Space Grotesk` + `Playfair Display:ital,wght@1,700`

### Key UI Patterns
- XP bars: `background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--purple), var(--salmon))`
- Section tags: small uppercase pill labels above headings
- Cards: dark background + subtle border + slight hover lift
- Buttons: salmon-filled (primary) or ghost outline (secondary)
- Animations: `float` (Oracle), `pulse-glow` (active elements), `xp-fill` (XP bars)
- Always dark theme — no light mode for now

### Tailwind Config
Extend the theme with the design tokens above. Add them to `tailwind.config.ts`.

